es the legacy Möbius left to mathematics in our own century.\n\nSubject\n\nMathematics Pure Mathematics\n\nCollection: Oxford Scholarship Online\n\nContents\n\n  * ### Front Matter\n\n    * Title Pages\n    * Preface\n  * One A Saxon mathematician John Fauvel\n\nView chapter\n\n  * Two The German mathematical community Gert Schuering\n\nView chapter\n\n  * Three The astrono1nical revolution Allan Chapman\n\nView chapter\n\n  * Four Möbius’s geometrical mechanics Jeremy Gray\n\nView chapter\n\n  * Five The development of topology Norman Biggs\n\nView chapter\n\n  * Six Möbius’s modern legacy Ian Stewart\n\nView chapter\n\n  * ### End Matter\n\n    * Notes of Contributors\n    * Picture Credits\n\n© Oxford University Press 1993--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPicture Credits | Möbius and his band: Mathematics and Astronomy in Nineteenth-century Germany | Oxford Academic (https://academic.oup.com/book/52834/chapter-abstract/421887848)\nciteturn848search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 33.5 years ago; Crawled: 5 months ago; Möbius and his band: Mathematics and Astronomy in Nineteenth-century Germany ... 13 May 1993 ... 165–167 ... Collection: Oxford Scholarship Online\n\nMöbius and his band: Mathematics and Astronomy in Nineteenth-century Germany\n\nJohn Fauvel et al.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1093/oso/9780198539698.001.0001\n\nPublished:\n\n13 May 1993\n\nOnline ISBN:\n\n9781383026696\n\nPrint ISBN:\n\n9780198539698\n\n[Input: Search in this book] Search in this book\n\n  1. Expand Front Matter\n\n  2. One A Saxon mathematician\n\n  3. Two The German mathematical community\n\n  4. Three The astrono1nical revolution\n\n  5. Four Möbius’s geometrical mechanics\n\n  6. Five The development of topology\n\n  7. Six Möbius’s modern legacy\n\n  8. Collapse End Matter\n\n# Picture Credits\n\nGet access\n\nJohn Fauvel,\n\nJohn Fauvel\n\nFind on\n\nOxford Academic\n\nGoogle Scholar\n\nRaymond Flood,\n\nRaymond Flood\n\nFind on\n\nOxford